9,-6,0,"Is this a new feature you landed somewhere else? It looks like we don't own this [flag](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:components/optimization_guide/core/optimization_guide_f…"],["6e8d764b_cea860e7",50,-6,1,"Is this because we currently don't have a feature yet? Or do we do this just to pass strings in?"],["8478f275_b5086c5d",50,-6,1,"Can we enable this by default in the test constructor since most tests will be testing with this enabled?"]],0,39],[7148399,20412,176,4.044,3.245,[[24,0.979,6,173],[27,0.021,0,3]],[["061e3a49_14165914",51,-3,1,"Add a comment about how execute server logs data to MQLS"],["25519e49_f1f42c1c",52,-3,0,"Is there any indicator that an upload is complete? Can we add some small UI that says that data was logged successfully? I'm not sure if getting a query response back implies a log is successfully…"],["9632e576_6185fece",52,-3,1,"Can we move this onto it's own line and do a simple `if(optimization_guide_service)`?"],["341b8f31_c03a00a1",52,-1,1,"nit for readability: Move the `_enableMQLSUpload` check here"],["723ed8c3_4f2f6884",52,-1,0,"nit: camel case (`loggingData` and `responseString`) for obj-c signatures"],["cdd3cc79_ee8790b8",52,-1,1,"`As<T>` returns an `std::optional`, so we should probably check `.has_value()` before accessing it, especially since we're just passing in a generic proto wrapper"],["d284be44_36fa2c3b",52,-1,1,"nit: Return early instead of wrapping in an if-statement ``` if (!optimization_guide_service) { return; } ```"]],0,40],[7188790,20416,16,0.634,0.471,[[24,7]],[],0,41],[7180445,20416,96,2.087,1.667,[[24,8]],[["c0ddaeb1_25cbc232",49,-3,0,"Do you know when this would return true for Bling? I'm not sure which of our channels are officially considered \"dogfood\". Bling operated a little differently in this regard compared to other surfaces"]],0,42],[7204482,20418,103,2.087,1.667,[[24,0.963,9,100],[27,0.037,1,3]],[],0,43],[7225875,20426,9,0.451,0.316,[[24,10]],[],0,44],[7210304,20427,2